{"type":"FeatureCollection","name":"取样点","features":[{"type":"Feature","properties":{"Mineral":"Ta Nb","Symbol":"Ta","Description":"这个是新找到的钽铌矿坑，地表发现一些石英，挖了1米，发现云母，石英，应该是伟晶岩类型。手工挑选的钽铌最高60%，综合混合样通过水洗后，摇床能富集到6%-10%钽铌。","_uid":"samples:samples:cb56dc24"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[30.183152,-13.124373]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"Mineral":"Ta Nb","Symbol":"Ta","Description":"发现钽铌矿，伟晶岩丰富。也发现大量的铍矿，铍矿大部分在石英岩石里面。","_uid":"samples:samples:64faddcb"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[30.157883,-13.125491]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"Mineral":"Ta Nb","Symbol":"Ta","Description":"比较完成的连续矿脉，云母石英明显。北边的钽铌矿脉比南边要深，大约在5-10米覆盖层以下。","_uid":"samples:samples:d30f9aff"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[30.156435,-13.122124]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"Mineral":"Ta Nb","Symbol":"Ta","Description":"这是目前最主要的矿脉，表面的覆盖层差不多1-3米左右。大量伟晶岩，钽铌颗粒明显，钽单颗最高60-70%，这些都是手工挑选。通过摇床，基本上可以富集到10-15%左右。但钛铁含量也在30-50%；","_uid":"samples:samples:0c26d2c1"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[30.158791,-13.128366]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"Mineral":"Ta Nb","Symbol":"Ta","Description":"表面挖坑1米，综合取样有钽铌。基本上摇床试验可以到6%钽含量","_uid":"samples:samples:01828091"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[30.164292,-13.132554]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"Mineral":"Ta Nb","Symbol":"Ta","Description":"表面挖坑1米，综合取样有钽铌。基本上摇床试验可以到6%钽含量","_uid":"samples:samples:62cd7cef"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[30.150263,-13.131015]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"Mineral":"Ta","Symbol":"Ta","Description":"挖了1-2米，找到明显的云母，石英。也有低品位的钽颗粒，原矿石化验光谱抢有钽铌0.04%-0.06%，但摇床做出来就是没法富集钽！","_uid":"samples:samples:ef3b5bf1"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[30.183496,-13.19944]}}]}